My fingers find the keys. The words are already forming in the sterile, practiced voice HQ expects.
<<play_sound Glitch 0.25>>
<<show MonitorSilhouette>>
Then the communication panel crackles.
The frequency I pinged back lights up, like it was waiting for me to look away.
    -> (answer the incoming connection)
