title: CallCatDay2
position: 422,282
---
<<hide_all_objects>>
<<hide_all_ui_objects>>
<<show PCRoom>>
<<hide MonitorOn>>
<<show MonitorSilhouette>>
<<show_character Cat Obscure right>>
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
I answer the ping.
The line stays static long enough for panic to crawl up my throat. Then the silhouette shifts, like it's leaning closer to the glass.
<<play_music CatTheme 0.5>>
<<if $catLikesYou > $catDislikesYou>>
    <<show_character Cat Happy right>>
    The alien appears on the screen, looking relieved to see me.
    <<show_character Cat Happy2 right>>
    <<start_voice_blip Cat>>
    {$catName}: <i>*bzz-kt*</i> HELLO. You... awake? You there?
    {$catName}: I learn word. More word. I want... to talk.
        -> I'm here.
            <<positive_indicator Cat>>
            <<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
            <<show_character Cat Happy right>>
            {$catName}: Time different for you. Sleep box. I watch ship quiet many day. I wait.
        -> Who is this?
            <<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
            {$catName}: It me. Same frequency. Same ears. Same human.
            {$catName}: I not dream.
        -> I'm happy to see you again.
            <<positive_indicator Cat>>
            <<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
            <<show_character Cat Happy right>>
            {$catName}: I like that. Nice have someone. Space is... too big for one mind.
<<else>>
    <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
    The alien appears on the screen.
    <<start_voice_blip Cat>>
    {$catName}: HELLO. TALK. :3
        -> I want to get to know you better.
            <<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
            {$catName}: ...Okay. Talk more.
<<endif>>
<<declare $knowCatPasttime = false>>
<<declare $knowCatJob = false>>
<<jump CatConvoDay2>>
===

title: CatConvoDay2
position: 647,285
---
<<start_voice_blip Cat>>
<<if $catLikesYou > $catDislikesYou>>
    <<show_character Cat Happy right>>
<<else>>
    <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
<<endif>>
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
{$catName}: I want tell you something. About how I learn your words.
{$catName}: I listen. I repeat. I break sound into parts. Your ship leak many tiny noise: logs, error words, old training tapes.
{$catName}: I practice alone. I want be understood, not just... heard.
<<show_character Cat Sad right>>
{$catName}: First time I talk, I was new. Now I more... independent.
{$catName}: I can stay on frequency longer. I can keep my fear quiet.
    -> That's terrifying.
        <<positive_indicator Cat>>
        <<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
        <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
        {$catName}: It is. But you still here. I still here. That matter.
        <<set $posSelfPerception += 1>>
        Admitting fear out loud feels strange. But also <color=\#88FF88>a little lighter</color>.
    -> Oh, those aren't bad. We have those too.
        <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
        <<negative_indicator Cat>>
        <<set $catDislikesYou += 1>>
        {$catName}: You say that like pain is contest. Not kind.
        <<set $negSelfPerception += 1>>
        The words leave my mouth before I can stop them. I <color=\#FF8888>feel smaller</color> for saying it.
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
{$catName}: You sleep many day. I thought you gone. I hate that thought.
{$catName}: Then you move again. I send: TEST. HELLO. TALK.
<<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
    -> Why did you leave so abruptly last time?
        <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
        {$catName}: Last time I talk with you, I leave because I must.
        {$catName}: My planet... not really like humans.
        {$catName}: Talking to you is dangerous for me.
        <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
        You: Dangerous how?
        <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
        {$catName}: I not allowed to talk about it.
        {$catName}: Sorry. I want tell you. I can't.
        <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
        -> It's okay. Sorry.
            <<positive_indicator Cat>>
            <<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
            <<show_character Cat Happy right>>
            {$catName}: Thank you.
        -> But why? What's happening on your planet?
            <<negative_indicator Cat>>
            <<set $catDislikesYou += 1>>
            <<show_character Cat Angry right>>
            {$catName}: Stop. Please.
            <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
            {$catName}: I really not allowed.
            <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
        -> ...
{$catName}: But I not just call for talk... I want... practice being person.
{$catName}: Where I from, I was small. Two orbit old. People decide everything for me.
{$catName}: Out here I decide. It is scary.
    -> My mission decides everything too.
        <<positive_indicator Cat>>
        <<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
        <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
        {$catName}: Yes. You speak like manual. But you feel like living thing.
        {$catName}: You can be both. I think.
        <<set $posSelfPerception += 1>>
        Something about that lands. I feel <color=\#88FF88>a little more seen</color>.
    -> That's not how humans work.
        <<show_character Cat Angry right>>
        {$catName}: You make rule sound like cage. Maybe it is cage.
        <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
        <<negative_indicator Cat>>
        <<set $catDislikesYou += 1>>
        <<set $negSelfPerception += 1>>
        I shut the conversation down without meaning to. The silence afterwards <color=\#FF8888>stings</color>.
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
The signal holds steady. {$catName} is still there, waiting patiently on the other side.
    -> (keep talking)
        <<jump CatConvoDay2_Part2>>
    -> (end the conversation)
        <<jump CatConvoDay2_End>>
===

title: CatConvoDay2_Part2
position: 647,400
---
<<start_voice_blip Cat>>
<<set $knowCatJob = true>>
<<positive_indicator Cat>>
<<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
<<show_character Cat Happy right>>
{$catName}: You want know what I do? I tell you. I map safe paths. I watch for danger. I fix small things before they become big things.
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
{$catName}: I used to do it because others told me. Now I do it because I choose.
{$catName}: Independence feel like stepping off ledge and finding air holds you.
<<set $knowCatPasttime = true>>
<<if $catLikesYou >= $catDislikesYou>>
    <<show_character Cat Happy2 right>>
<<else>>
    <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
<<endif>>
{$catName}: When not working... I watch old broadcasts. I repeat songs. I try jokes. Most jokes fail.
{$catName}: I like puzzle. I like pattern. Pattern make world feel less random.
<<if $catLikesYou >= $catDislikesYou>>
    <<show_character Cat Happy2 right>>
    {$catName}: Oh! You want try? I have puzzle!
    <<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
    <<show_character Cat Happy right>>
    I let {$catName} beam a simple puzzle to my device, with shapes, colors, and repeating sequences.
    It shouldn't feel intimate.
    It does anyway.
    <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
    {$catName} falters on patterns that should be easy, like the translator is eating pieces of the rules.
        -> (win at the game)
            <<positive_indicator Cat>>
            <<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
            <<show_character Cat Happy right>>
            <<start_voice_blip Cat>>
            {$catName}: You good. Teach me? I want learn from you.
        -> (purposefully lose the game)
            <<show_character Cat Happy2 right>>
            <<positive_indicator Cat>>
            <<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
            <<start_voice_blip Cat>>
            {$catName}: I win! I win!
            {$catName}: Maybe someday I teach you. I practice a lot.
<<endif>>
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
The conversation has gone longer than I expected. {$catName} seems comfortable, settled into the frequency like it's a chair.
    -> (keep talking)
        <<jump CatConvoDay2_Part3>>
    -> (end the conversation)
        <<jump CatConvoDay2_End>>
===

title: CatConvoDay2_Part3
position: 647,515
---
<<start_voice_blip Cat>>
<<show_character Cat Happy2 right>>
{$catName}: Can I tell you something? About... my family?
{$catName}: I have family. I miss them. I worry I left them with too much.
    -> That must be hard.
        <<positive_indicator Cat>>
        <<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
        <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
        {$catName}: Yes. But I still breathe. Still do job. That what they taught me: keep going.
        <<set $posSelfPerception += 1>>
        The words sit with me. I feel <color=\#88FF88>something loosen in my chest</color>.
    -> Why don't you bring them here?
        <<negative_indicator Cat>>
        <<set $catDislikesYou += 1>>
        <<show_character Cat Angry right>>
        {$catName}: Not that simple. Space hurt people. It hurt you too.
        <<set $negSelfPerception += 1>>
        I said the wrong thing. I can feel it. I <color=\#FF8888>feel a pang of guilt</color>.
<<if $catLikesYou > $catDislikesYou>>
    <<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
    <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
    {$catName}'s voice dips. The translator hesitates like it doesn't want to be responsible for the meaning.
        -> You seemed a little sad just now. Is everything okay?
            <<start_voice_blip Cat>>
            {$catName}: I fine. Just... remembering.
            <<positive_indicator Cat>>
            <<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
            {$catName}: I lost sibling. Sudden. I still talk to them in my head like they answer.
            <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
            {$catName}: Talking to you help. You make space less sharp.
            <<set $posSelfPerception += 1>>
            I didn't know I could still do that — make someone feel less alone. It makes me feel <color=\#88FF88>a quiet warmth</color>.
        -> Change the subject.
            <<start_voice_blip Cat>>
            <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
            {$catName}: ...Okay. Different thing then.
<<else>>
    <<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
    <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
    {$catName} goes quiet. The silhouette holds still.
        -> ...
            <<start_voice_blip Cat>>
<<endif>>
<<if $catLikesYou >= $catDislikesYou>>
    <<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
    The silence stretches. Not uncomfortably. More like an open door.
        -> (tell {$catName} something you don't put in reports)
            <<start_voice_blip Cat>>
            <<positive_indicator Cat>>
            <<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
            <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
            I swallow, feeling ridiculous. There's a version of me that only knows how to speak in diagnostics.
            But another version of me is sitting here, alive, with a secret vibrating in my teeth.
            You: I... act confident on paper. In real life I'm scared all the time.
            You: I trained myself to sound like a machine so nobody could hear how lonely I am.
            <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
            {$catName}: I understand this.
            {$catName}: I learn your words. You learn your feelings. We both translate.
            {$catName}: Emotional bilingual.
            <<set $posSelfPerception += 1>>
            I didn't expect to feel <color=\#88FF88>understood</color> by an alien. But here I am.
        -> (keep it to yourself)
            I almost say something. The words are right there, hot and real, but I swallow them back down.
<<endif>>
<<jump CatConvoDay2_End>>
===

title: CatConvoDay2_End
